<title>UK: Merck adds 100 mln Sfr to Nov 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Merck adds 100 mln Sfr to Nov 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERCK AG</p>
<p> AMT  **100 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    29.NOV.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.15    PAY DATE    21.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STD	 REOFFER    =	   EOS	   28.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES    **REOPENING OF 300 MLN SFR BOND.</p>
<p>		PLUS 112 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
